    "Decompose aggressively: each lower target must fit one agent context window.",
    "Specify more than the theorem: include local APIs, imports, theorem cards, and intended proof route.",
    "Treat repeated failure as mathematical signal: audit the statement, assumptions, or counterexample before more tactic search.",
    "Make hidden regularity reusable: integrability, measurability, continuity, nonemptiness, boundedness, positivity, summability, and adaptedness become named contracts.",
